 "title": "LM393, LM293, LM2903, LM2903V, NCV2903, NCV2903V: low offset voltage dual comparators",
 "source": {
  "document": "LM393/D",
  "revision": "Rev. 25, April 2014",
  "pages": 10
 },
 "summary": "A dual voltage comparator with open-collector outputs that works from a single 2.0 V to 36 V supply or from ±1.0 V to ±18 V rails. The input common mode range includes ground, supply current is about 0.4 mA for the pair, and the LM293/LM393 offset is 5.0 mV at most at 25 °C. Grades LM293, LM393, LM2903, LM2903V, NCV2903 and NCV2903V differ in temperature range and limits. LM393DR2G is the LM393 (0 °C to +70 °C) in SOIC-8 on a 2500-piece reel.",
